cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "EIT-LJ Cube Bifurcations (Paper 3): code, certificates and audit records"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Code, rigorous computer-assisted certificates, certificate checkers, tests, negative controls, proof dependency
  graphs, independent audit records and manuscript sources for Paper 3, "Symmetry-Breaking Bifurcations from the Cubic
  Equilibrium in Two-Term Inverse-Power Clusters": the local branches born at the A2u and T2g transition curves of the
  cubic equilibrium of eight particles with V(r) = A r^-p - B r^-q (A2u pitchfork; D3d transcritical branches; D2h
  pitchfork; centre-manifold and full-slice inertia of the D2h branch). Release candidate V1.0.0-rc2 of this package
  passed an independent final blind release audit (a computational release verification, not journal peer review).
  Software: PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0. Manuscript, documentation, figures, generated results and package-authored metadata: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Commercial use only by separate written agreement. Copyright © 2026 EITNetworks LLC and the authors.
